BT /F2 11 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 724 Td (1. Executive Summary & Business Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 704 Td (As consumer travel booking transitions from manual web searches to autonomous AI agents \(e.g., MakeMyTrip bots, Expedia concierges,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 693 Td (and Google Gemini personal assistants\), commercial airlines face an unprecedented governance challenge. Autonomous agents can search,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 682 Td (book, modify, and cancel flights on behalf of passengers. While frictionless, this introduces critical operational and commercial risks:) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 668 Td (\(o\) Financial Risk & Hallucination Exposure:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Agents may misinterpret intent or hallucinate booking criteria, causing unexpected charges.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 657 Td (\(o\) Operational & Itinerary Disruption:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Arbitrary schedule changes disrupt itineraries, risk missed connections, and incur airline fees.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 646 Td (\(o\) Irreversible Inventory Depletion:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Cancellations and refunds release airline seat inventory and trigger payouts, demanding strict oversight.) Tj ET
0.95 0.96 0.98 rg 36 618 523.28 32 re f
