BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 791 Td (4. Technology Stack & Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 774 Td (\(o\) Programming Language:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Python 3.11 with clean modular separation \(core/config.py, core/database.py, core/gatekeeper.py\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 764 Td (\(o\) Persistent Database:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( SQLite \(sqlite3 built-in\), ACID relational persistence, permanent registered_at & revoked_at timestamps.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 754 Td (\(o\) Zero-Dependency Server:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Built-in Python http.server \(server.py\) serving responsive HTML5/CSS/JS dashboard at http://localhost:8501.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 744 Td (\(o\) Streamlit Interface:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Streamlit dashboard \(app.py\) with Plotly analytics for environments with optional packages installed.) Tj ET
